00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:40.740
In part two, Pi Pi returns

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:42.600
with a kingdom of monetizable piss,

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:45.210
and he has big dreams for
his wee-wee water slide

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:48.270
to supply South Park with
enough pee for every faucet,

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:50.880
