00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:53.520
it becomes our individual responsibility

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:55.800
to keep things running during peak demand.

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.150
We didn't cause these problems.

00:08:57.150 --> 00:08:58.500
We can't really fix them,

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:01.290
but we are asked to take
on the responsibility

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:03.510
of making things a little less bad.

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:05.520
Individuals are asked to sacrifice

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:06.900
while governments and corporations

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.610
keep it business as usual.

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:11.370
If this sounds like a
discouraging bummer, it is.

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:13.860
And we see this defeat isn't
at the end of the special.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:15.851
- We have enough water for the summer now,

00:09:15.851 --> 00:09:16.710
(beep) it.

00:09:16.710 --> 00:09:18.360
Let's smoke some weed!

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:20.790
- The group decides it would
be too much of a hassle

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:21.780
to kill Chuck Chuck,

00:09:21.780 --> 00:09:24.030
